# spec: real-world -- Stripe API, form-encoded bodies and bracketed parameter names
@stripe = https://api.stripe.com/v1

### create-customer
POST {{stripe}}/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{stripeSecretKey}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Jenny+Rosen&email=jenny.rosen%40example.com&description=Test+customer

> {%
    client.global.set("customerId", response.body.id);
%}

### create-payment-intent
POST {{stripe}}/payment_intents
Authorization: Bearer {{stripeSecretKey}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

amount=2000&currency=eur&customer={{customerId}}&automatic_payment_methods[enabled]=true

### list-charges
GET {{stripe}}/charges?limit=3
Authorization: Bearer {{stripeSecretKey}}
